  "title": "Roasted Sweet Potato Salad with Feta",
  "description": "Roasted sweet potatoes, cashews, feta, and a trio of mixed greens are dressed with a simple balsamic vinaigrette in this beautiful and tasty salad.",
  "authors": [
    "Melanie Booth"
  ],
